title = Giant Barrel Cactus
description = Echinocactus platyacanthus is a member of the cactus family Cactaceae. It is also known as the giant barrel cactus, golden barrel cactus, giant viznaga, or biznaga de dulce, and its Nahuatl (Aztec) name is huitzli nahual. It is native to central Mexico in the Chihuahuan Desert. This species is the largest of the barrel cacti.
